diff --git a/docs/ops/devops.md b/docs/ops/devops.md
index 86228f9..71d8759 100644
--- a/docs/ops/devops.md
+++ b/docs/ops/devops.md
@@ -66,9 +66,10 @@ ## Discord ops alerts
 
 | Item | Detail |
 | --- | --- |
-| Env | `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL` → `config('services.discord.webhook_url')` |
+| Env | `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL` → `config('services.discord.webhook_url')`; `DISCORD_MENTION_ID` → `config('services.discord.mention_id')` |
 | Client | `App\Ops\DiscordOpsAlert::send($title, $message, $context = [])` |
-| Unconfigured | Empty/missing URL → silent no-op (safe for CI) |
+| Unconfigured webhook | Empty/missing URL → silent no-op (safe for CI) |
+| Unconfigured mention | Empty/missing mention ID → no ping; when set to a valid Discord snowflake (17–20 digits), appends `<@USER_ID>` to the alert |
 | Failures | Non-2xx / transport errors are logged without the webhook URL; they do not throw |
 
 Call from jobs/handlers when a notable ops event occurs; do not wire every exception globally.
